# Project Roadmap - Allen Lab Report Tool

## Phase 1 (Current)
- Define adapted CGCS for aneuploidy
- Create modular encoding for chr21 genes
- Write white paper and proposal

## Phase 2
- Build Python tools to compute CGCS from RNA-seq data
- Test on public Down syndrome datasets
- Create visualization notebooks

## Phase 3
- Simulate intervention effects
- Collaborate with Allen Lab on real datasets
- Explore person-to-person variability modeling
